window.MG_LAZY_DATA["data/lazy/resources/qpu-v25-026-ae5f9c28cf164deb.json"]={sha256:"ae5f9c28cf164debb09fd0e037856db1004b4ff4147d623b7f9b6384e430d530",value:{"sources":[{"id":"v25-case-9dad25457bdb4a58","url":"https://qiskit-community.github.io/qiskit-experiments/manuals/verification/randomized_benchmarking.html","title":"Randomized Benchmarking","titleEn":"Randomized Benchmarking","publisher":"Qiskit Experiments maintainers","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."}],"media":{"courses":[{"courseId":"qpu-v25-026","videos":[],"guides":[]}]},"related":{"courses":[{"courseId":"qpu-v25-026","related":[{"id":"qpu-v25-027","referenceUrls":["https://qiskit-community.github.io/qiskit-experiments/manuals/verification/randomized_benchmarking.html"],"title":"Qiskit 交錯基準：目標雙量子門誤差","titleEn":"Qiskit interleaved benchmarking: target two-qubit gate error","why":"用兩課的可觀察驗收條件比較模型邊界：逐項標記通過、失敗或資料不足，不以熟悉品牌代替證據。最終交接必須包括：交付衰減曲線、SPAM／EPC區分及批次穩定性報告。 所有通過結論只在本課明列假設內成立。","whyEn":"Compare model boundaries using observable acceptance criteria: Mark each item pass, fail or insufficient evidence; a familiar brand is not proof. Final handover must include: Deliver decay curves, SPAM/EPC distinctions and a batch-stability report. Every pass remains conditional on the stated teaching assumptions.","difference":"建立『Qiskit 交錯基準：目標雙量子門誤差』可核算的名義與變更模型，區分實際來源背景、合成輸入及驗收證據。成果：交付比值推導、負估計反例及配對採樣計畫。","differenceEn":"Build reproducible nominal and changed models for 'Qiskit interleaved benchmarking: target two-qubit gate error', separating sourced context, synthetic inputs and acceptance evidence. Outcome: Deliver the ratio derivation, a negative-estimate counterexample and paired sampling plan.","transfer":"保留單位與邊界條件，僅轉移可證明相容的驗證方法。","transferEn":"Retain units and boundary conditions; transfer only demonstrably compatible verification methods.","practice":["先從模型逐項推導，標記量綱與近似：擬合P(m)=Aα^m+B後，單量子位元EPC=(1−α)/2；依賴RB模型，不是每個原生門的錯誤。 使用教學α=0.998，A=0.48，B=0.5；Clifford長度m無單位。 以手算或試算表計算名義式(1-0.998)/2，另開一欄執行獨立核對：生成m=0、100、200的P值再反推α；P(0)=0.98而非1是SPAM參數造成，不應強制改寫。","先從模型逐項推導，標記量綱與近似：d=4時教學估計rG=(d−1)/d×(1−αI/αR)；參考與交錯噪聲假設須相容。 使用合成αR=0.990、αI=0.984，d=4；不將兩個α直接相減當門誤差。 以手算或試算表計算名義式(3/4)*(1-0.984/0.990)，另開一欄執行獨立核對：檢查αI=αR時估計為0；αI>αR的負值應被標記，不能解釋為超越完美門。","比較兩個模型的輸入、誤差與驗收條件，記錄不能沿用的假設。"],"practiceEn":["Derive each term, marking dimensions and approximations: After fitting P(m)=Aα^m+B, single-qubit EPC=(1−α)/2; this RB-model quantity is not every native gate error. Use Teaching α=0.998, A=0.48 and B=0.5; Clifford length m is dimensionless. Evaluate nominal expression (1-0.998)/2 by hand or spreadsheet, then independently check: Generate P at m=0,100,200 and recover α; P(0)=0.98 reflects SPAM parameters and should not be forced to1.","Derive each term, marking dimensions and approximations: For d=4 use teaching estimate rG=(d−1)/d×(1−αI/αR); reference and interleaved noise assumptions must be compatible. Use Synthetic αR=0.990, αI=0.984 and d=4; do not equate the raw α difference with gate error. Evaluate nominal expression (3/4)*(1-0.984/0.990) by hand or spreadsheet, then independently check: Check zero estimate when αI=αR; flag negative estimates for αI>αR rather than calling them better-than-perfect gates.","Compare inputs, errors, and criteria; document assumptions that cannot be transferred."]},{"id":"qpu-v25-036","referenceUrls":["https://www.ionq.com/resources/reconfigurable-multicore-quantum-architecture"],"title":"IonQ 個別定址：Gaussian 光束串擾","titleEn":"IonQ individual addressing: Gaussian-beam crosstalk","why":"用兩課的可觀察驗收條件比較模型邊界：逐項標記通過、失敗或資料不足，不以熟悉品牌代替證據。最終交接必須包括：交付衰減曲線、SPAM／EPC區分及批次穩定性報告。 所有通過結論只在本課明列假設內成立。","whyEn":"Compare model boundaries using observable acceptance criteria: Mark each item pass, fail or insufficient evidence; a familiar brand is not proof. Final handover must include: Deliver decay curves, SPAM/EPC distinctions and a batch-stability report. Every pass remains conditional on the stated teaching assumptions.","difference":"建立『IonQ 個別定址：Gaussian 光束串擾』可核算的名義與變更模型，區分實際來源背景、合成輸入及驗收證據。成果：交付光斑截面、強度／場幅區分及失焦診斷。","differenceEn":"Build reproducible nominal and changed models for 'IonQ individual addressing: Gaussian-beam crosstalk', separating sourced context, synthetic inputs and acceptance evidence. Outcome: Deliver beam sections, intensity/field-amplitude distinctions and defocus diagnosis.","transfer":"保留單位與邊界條件，僅轉移可證明相容的驗證方法。","transferEn":"Retain units and boundary conditions; transfer only demonstrably compatible verification methods.","practice":["先從模型逐項推導，標記量綱與近似：擬合P(m)=Aα^m+B後，單量子位元EPC=(1−α)/2；依賴RB模型，不是每個原生門的錯誤。 使用教學α=0.998，A=0.48，B=0.5；Clifford長度m無單位。 以手算或試算表計算名義式(1-0.998)/2，另開一欄執行獨立核對：生成m=0、100、200的P值再反推α；P(0)=0.98而非1是SPAM參數造成，不應強制改寫。","先從模型逐項推導，標記量綱與近似：Gaussian強度比I(d)/I0=exp(−2d²/w²)，w是1/e²強度半徑；Rabi頻率比為其平方根。 使用教學離子間距d=4 μm、光束w=2 μm；只計單束幾何尾端。 以手算或試算表計算名義式exp(-2*4**2/2**2)，另開一欄執行獨立核對：檢查d=0比值1；以ln(I/I0)對d²斜率−2/w²重估腰寬。","比較兩個模型的輸入、誤差與驗收條件，記錄不能沿用的假設。"],"practiceEn":["Derive each term, marking dimensions and approximations: After fitting P(m)=Aα^m+B, single-qubit EPC=(1−α)/2; this RB-model quantity is not every native gate error. Use Teaching α=0.998, A=0.48 and B=0.5; Clifford length m is dimensionless. Evaluate nominal expression (1-0.998)/2 by hand or spreadsheet, then independently check: Generate P at m=0,100,200 and recover α; P(0)=0.98 reflects SPAM parameters and should not be forced to1.","Derive each term, marking dimensions and approximations: Gaussian intensity ratio I(d)/I0=exp(−2d²/w²), where w is1/e² intensity radius; Rabi-frequency ratio is its square root. Use Teaching ion spacing d=4 μm and beam w=2 μm; consider only the geometric tail of one beam. Evaluate nominal expression exp(-2*4**2/2**2) by hand or spreadsheet, then independently check: Check ratio1 at d=0; recover waist from slope−2/w² of ln(I/I0) versus d².","Compare inputs, errors, and criteria; document assumptions that cannot be transferred."]}],"references":[{"id":"v25-case-9dad25457bdb4a58","url":"https://qiskit-community.github.io/qiskit-experiments/manuals/verification/randomized_benchmarking.html","title":"Randomized Benchmarking","titleEn":"Randomized Benchmarking","publisher":"Qiskit Experiments","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."},{"id":"v25-case-dae958d58b59b34a","url":"https://www.ionq.com/resources/reconfigurable-multicore-quantum-architecture","title":"Reconfigurable Multicore Quantum Architecture","titleEn":"Reconfigurable Multicore Quantum Architecture","publisher":"IonQ","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."}],"overview":"比較相鄰案例與另一組案例的模型、可量測結果及可轉移的驗證方法。","overviewEn":"Compare neighboring and cross-group cases by model, measurable outcome, and transferable verification method."}]},"places":{"courses":[]},"vendors":{"courses":[],"vendors":[]}}};
